// LevelUpLimit for Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic (Switch 1.0.4)
// Original x86 patch author: Arniel_Stanislaus aka LanguageWriter123
// (with revisions from Lane)
// Semantic source: LevelUpLimit.kpatch / kotor1_gog_103 hooks
//
// Raises the maximum character level from 20 to 50 and adds the
// required 2DA data files. Switch VAs are shown in the comments;
// pchtxt offsets are VA - 0x7100000000.

